door plank~
1. The shack is missing a door. 2. this plank would probably cover
most of the entrance to the shack if it were hung with the ropes
attached to this plank through the loops in the doorframe of the
shack. 3. This plank actually Smells of Chicken. Let's go out on a
limb and say this plank is the door.
~
